EXPLAIN FORMAT=TREE SELECT pkey, SUM(bval) AS sb, SUM(pval) AS sp, COUNT(*) AS n
FROM num_probe JOIN num_build ON pkey = bkey GROUP BY pkey;
EXPLAIN
-> Group vectorized aggregate: sum(num_build.bval), sum(num_probe.pval), count(0)  (...)
